        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "The whole point of 'mini.bufremove' is that it does not change layout after buffer unshow/delete/wipeout. Closing tabpage is a layout change so it is not aligned with 'mini.bufremove' design.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
